{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "アルバムの新曲の『My respect』、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私がすごく好きなシーンがあって"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2サビの最後の''君は君でいい''の箇所、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私の場所からりかさんの背中越しに美波さんに手を延ばす振りがあるんです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "目の前のふたつの大切な背中をステージで眼差せなくなる…って考えるととても寂しくなります。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "曲への思い出が募って募って、乃木坂でいる月日の意味ってきっとこういう瞬間に宿るんだって感じます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "寂しさと行かないでという気持ち、その一方でなんのネガティブな思いも残さずに卒業する姿を送り出すならきっと私にできることは頼もしい姿をいっぱい示さなければという気持ち。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "せめぎ合います。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あ〜〜〜眩しいっ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "何もかも、！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": ".*･ﾟ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46 5期生の池田瑛紗です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2月はたくさんの出来事がありましたね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ライブも続きました、4日間も…！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "過ぎ去る間には永遠に感じて、終わってしまえば一瞬より短く感じる"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私の人生はその連続ですが、LIVEは果たしてその瞬間が繰り返される感覚です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46の楽曲には、ひとつひとつに物語がある様で"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私は披露している間その世界の中に紛れ込むような世界観の浸り方をしています。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202603/mobKjfQlt.png", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202603/mobnL1ORc.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "楽しかった！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃⽊坂46 Coupling Collection 2022-2025"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃⽊坂46 5th ALBUM MEMORIAL LIVE 『My respect』"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "来てくださった皆さん、配信で見てくださった皆さん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございましたm(_ _)m"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まずはカップリングコレクションから。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "カップリング曲は、表題曲とはまた違う色を持っているものが多くて、ライブで披露することで改めて曲の魅力を感じる瞬間がたくさんありました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ファンの皆さんの中にも「この曲が好き」とそれぞれの思い入れがあると思いますが、そんな曲たちを集めたライブに参加できたことがとても嬉しかったです^. ̫ .^ฅ゛"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "軍団曲も披露できて嬉しいですっ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちなみに皆さんはいけだぬきとてれねこ、どっちが好きでしたか〜| ε:)ちら"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大好きなアニメに関われた『あの光』、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "黄色いセーラー服を先輩からお借りした『銭湯ラプソディー』"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みりねが美月さんポジションでしたね♨️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "『深読み』では、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "齋藤飛鳥さんのポジションに入らせていただきました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "すごーく嬉しい！パフォーマンスの瞬間瞬間が楽しくて、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そしてこの曲の世界観を壊さないように大切に披露させていただきました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして『My respect』発売記念ライブ。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "アルバムタイトルにもある通り、「respect」という言葉がとても印象に残るライブだったと思います。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46というグループは、先輩方が築いてくださった歴史があって今の私たちが立てています。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "その歴史や想いに触れながらパフォーマンスをする時間は、いつも特別です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "自分がいただいたポジションも、先輩からお借りしたポジションもそれぞれに全力でリスペクトを込めました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そしてステージから見えるサイリウムの景色はいつもとても綺麗で、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんが曲を大切に聴いてくださっているのが伝わってきて、胸がいっぱいになりました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ライブのたびに「この場所をもっと素敵なものにしたい」と強く思います。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつも応援してくださってありがとうございます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そしてそして"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "14th YEAR BIRTHDAY LIVE"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "真夏の全国ツアー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "発表されました🎂❕"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "バスラの最終日は美波さんの卒業コンサートも開催されます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最高の時間を皆さんと過ごしたいな、皆さんにそんな素敵な景色をお届けできるように頑張ります。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんがチケット当選しますように！てれさぱんだ発券🐼🎟💭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私にとっては東京ドームは特別な場所です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "目指せスーパーアイドル！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202603/mob3UEYNX.png", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "3日目4日目は期別ブロックからのスタートだったんですが、美波さんが出番の直前に「『My respect』で会おう！」って言ってくださるんですね、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それで冒頭のシーンになるんです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "尊敬の思いは愛に繋がるんだってことをたくさん教えていただきました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202603/mob9B8E5l.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type